    "App 会自动重新建立需要的连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps reconnect on their own when they need to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloudflare（DoH，经代理）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudflare (DoH, via proxy)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GEOIP,CN、GEOSITE,cn 和 GEOSITE,gfw 没有订阅自带的规则集时，使用公开列表（Loyalsoldier、gaoyifan），由内核每天直连下载一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the subscription has no rule set for GEOIP,CN, GEOSITE,cn or GEOSITE,gfw, public lists (Loyalsoldier, gaoyifan) are used; the engine downloads them directly once a day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google（DoH，经代理）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
