            "value": "连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”已设为当前节点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is now the current node."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上传": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upload"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上传、下载为该连接经隧道的字节数。目标域名来自请求本身或 TLS SNI / HTTP Host，只保存在内存里，断开隧道即清空。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upload and download are the bytes this connection moved through the tunnel. Host names come from the request or the TLS SNI / HTTP Host, are kept in memory only and are cleared when the tunnel stops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次下载失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last download failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次停止原因": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last Stop Reason"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次更新失败（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last update failed (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下拉更新全部订阅。延迟为经该节点请求 http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204 的 HTTP 真连接时间，5 秒无响应显示超时。连接中切换节点会自动重连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull down to update every subscription. Delay is the time of a real HTTP request to http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204 through the node; no answer in 5 seconds shows Timeout. Switching nodes while connected reconnects automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支持": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不收集你的流量和浏览记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your traffic and browsing aren't collected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "二维码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从上到下第一条命中的规则生效。RULE-SET 使用规则页的规则集，例如 geosite-cn；只有单个节点、没有订阅规则时它不会命中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first matching rule from the top wins. RULE-SET uses the rule sets on the rules page, such as geosite-cn; it never matches with a single node and no subscription rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从剪贴板导入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import from Clipboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
