            "value": "Imported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入带规则和策略组的订阅（Clash、Surge、Loon 配置）后，可以在这里按订阅规则分流和切换策略组。现在全部流量走所选节点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you import a subscription with rules and policy groups (a Clash, Surge or Loon profile), you can route by its rules and switch its policy groups here. Right now all traffic goes through the selected node."
          }
